<section class="section section--tight" aria-labelledby="verify-title">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div>
      <h2 id="verify-title">Check it in three ways</h2>
      <ol class="mini-steps test-steps">
        <li>Use the department's {% ext "https://eportal.incometax.gov.in/iec/foservices/#/pre-login/authenticate-notice-issued-by-itd", "Authenticate Notice service" %}.</li>
        <li>Log in yourself by typing the portal address, and look under pending actions or e-proceedings. Do not use a link from the message.</li>
        <li>Check that your PAN, name, year and any Document Identification Number match.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="para"><strong>Warning signs:</strong> requests for OTPs or passwords, payment to a personal account or by UPI to an individual, threats of immediate arrest, or unfamiliar links.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Then read these five things</h2>
      <dl class="fit-list">
        <div><dt>Which Act and section?</dt><dd>Older years may still fall under the 1961 Act, and later ones under the 2025 Act. Use what the notice cites.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Which year?</dt><dd>Often not the current one. You may need old records.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>What is it asking for?</dt><dd>Information, a correction, or tax.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>By when?</dt><dd>There is no single period for all notices. The date on your notice controls.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Is it from a person, or automated?</dt><dd>An automated intimation may need a different response from a query from an officer.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="scale-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 id="scale-title">How serious is it? A rough guide</h2>
      <p>Our general sorting, based on what notices commonly ask. Your notice may not fit neatly, and section numbers differ under the 2025 Act.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="data-table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label="Notice seriousness, scrolls sideways on small screens">
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">What you received</th><th scope="col">Often means</th><th scope="col">Sensible next step</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Intimation after processing</th><td>The department's figures differ from yours, or your return was processed</td><td>Compare the figures. Many can be understood with your accountant</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Defective return notice</th><td>Your return has a technical problem</td><td>Correct it within the time stated</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Information mismatch or compliance message</th><td>Reported information differs from your return</td><td>Respond on the portal, and check the source of the data</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Request for documents in an assessment</th><td>Your return is being examined</td><td>Get professional help before replying</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Notice to reopen a past year, demand, penalty or search-related</th><td>Serious, with legal consequences</td><td>Get a qualified professional now</td></tr>
